---
manual: check.focus
lines: [2995, 2998]
testability: interactive
display: native
ledger: G9
expect: fail
reason: "Lacci focuses the check (G9), but native/src/elements/check.rs `activates` takes Space only, where button.rs also takes Enter; the wave-5 Rust lane adds Enter."
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @first = check
  @second = check
end
----------- test code
second = check("@second")
second.focus
assert_equal second.linkable_id, focused_drawable&.linkable_id, "focus moves keyboard focus to the check"

press_key "\n"
assert_equal true, second.checked?, "Enter toggles the focused check on"
assert_equal false, check("@first").checked?, "and leaves the other one alone"

press_key "\n"
assert_equal false, second.checked?, "Enter toggles it off again"
